---
/**
 * The FORTIS perception and state estimation chains, typeset as an inline SVG.
 * Structure and fusion rules are from the repository: per-camera clouds fused
 * into a voxel map with cross-run diff, and an EKF that takes translation only
 * from wheel odometry and visual odometry while the gyroscope owns yaw.
 */
---

<figure>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 740 330"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Two-lane diagram. Mapping lane: four chassis depth cameras feed per-camera depth to cloud nodes, into multi-camera fusion in the body frame, into a persistent voxel map, into a cross-run diff against a saved reference map. Estimation lane: wheel odometry contributing translation only, front-camera keyframe visual odometry contributing translation only, and the gyroscope owning yaw, all fused by an Extended Kalman Filter into one continuous pose estimate."
    style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--rule)"
  >
    <defs>
      <marker id="fpd-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill="var(--ink-muted)"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">
      <g font-size="10" fill="var(--ink-muted)" letter-spacing="1.5">
        <text x="20" y="28">MAPPING</text>
        <text x="20" y="188">STATE ESTIMATION</text>
      </g>

      <!-- mapping lane -->
      <rect x="20" y="42" width="112" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="76" y="60" text-anchor="middle">4 chassis</text>
      <text x="76" y="76" text-anchor="middle">depth cams</text>

      <rect x="172" y="42" width="112" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="228" y="60" text-anchor="middle">depth to</text>
      <text x="228" y="76" text-anchor="middle">cloud, per cam</text>

      <rect x="324" y="42" width="112" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="380" y="60" text-anchor="middle">fusion in</text>
      <text x="380" y="76" text-anchor="middle">body frame</text>

      <rect x="476" y="42" width="100" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="526" y="60" text-anchor="middle">voxel</text>
      <text x="526" y="76" text-anchor="middle">map</text>

      <rect x="616" y="42" width="104" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="668" y="60" text-anchor="middle">diff vs</text>
      <text x="668" y="76" text-anchor="middle">saved run</text>

      <!-- estimation lane -->
      <rect x="20" y="202" width="140" height="40" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="90" y="227" text-anchor="middle">wheel odometry</text>

      <rect x="20" y="254" width="140" height="40" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="90" y="279" text-anchor="middle">front-cam VO</text>

      <rect x="20" y="150" width="140" height="40" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="90" y="175" text-anchor="middle">gyroscope</text>

      <rect x="330" y="196" width="110" height="56" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="385" y="228" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">EKF</text>

      <rect x="560" y="202" width="140" height="44" fill="var(--wash)" stroke="var(--rule-strong)"></rect>
      <text x="630" y="220" text-anchor="middle">continuous</text>
      <text x="630" y="236" text-anchor="middle">pose</text>

      <!-- arrows -->
      <g stroke="var(--ink-muted)" fill="none" stroke-width="1.25" marker-end="url(#fpd-arrow)">
        <line x1="132" y1="64" x2="168" y2="64"></line>
        <line x1="284" y1="64" x2="320" y2="64"></line>
        <line x1="436" y1="64" x2="472" y2="64"></line>
        <line x1="576" y1="64" x2="612" y2="64"></line>
        <line x1="160" y1="170" x2="326" y2="208"></line>
        <line x1="160" y1="222" x2="326" y2="222"></line>
        <line x1="160" y1="274" x2="326" y2="240"></line>
        <line x1="440" y1="224" x2="556" y2="224"></line>
      </g>

      <!-- fusion rules -->
      <g font-size="10" fill="var(--ink-muted)">
        <text x="180" y="150">yaw only</text>
        <text x="180" y="214">translation only</text>
        <text x="180" y="292">translation only, keyframe-anchored</text>
        <text x="20" y="120">front camera also feeds detection and click-to-target, which hand the mission FSM its target pose</text>
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The two perception products. The mapping chain ends in a cross-run diff,
    which is the inspection deliverable; the estimation chain fuses three
    sources under explicit trust rules, with heading owned by the gyroscope
    alone.
    <span class="figcaption__source">Source: repository perception and localization packages, drawn from their documented contracts.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
